OL,3,GNEWSADancers, DJs and drummers as
OL,4,ANotting Hill Carnival celebrates 60th
OL,5,Aanniversary
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt's the third and final day of this
OL,8,Fyear's Notting Hill Carnival - Europe's
OL,9,Flargest street festival
OL,11,FThe adults' parade is bringing
OL,12,Fthousands of performers, spectacular
OL,13,Fcostumes and music-filled floats to the
OL,14,Fstreets of west London
OL,16,FOn Sunday, 169 arrests were made, but
OL,17,Fpolice described the mood as
OL,18,F"overwhelmingly positive and
OL,19,Fcelebratory"
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
